1
00:01:20,319 --> 00:01:21,400
But in just one day,

2
00:01:21,719 --> 00:01:23,599
it has been pre-ordered a thousand copies in the capital.

3
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,239
How is it?

4
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:26,680
Miss Zhang's move

5
00:01:26,959 --> 00:01:28,239
is indeed extraordinary.

6
00:01:28,799 --> 00:01:31,040
It will be officially released nationwide tomorrow.

7
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,200
Soon,

8
00:01:32,599 --> 00:01:34,959
you will become the most popular poet.

9
00:01:35,719 --> 00:01:37,560
All this is thanks to Miss Zhang.

10
00:01:38,319 --> 00:01:39,640
But may I ask,

11
00:01:40,079 --> 00:01:42,000
when will I receive my reward?

12
00:01:42,319 --> 00:01:42,920
Don't worry.

13
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:45,400
It's time to prepare for the poetry club.

14
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:46,480
If you need,

15
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:47,719
I'll do my best.

16
00:01:50,439 --> 00:01:51,079
This,

17
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:53,519
take a few back to Mr. Su.

18
00:01:53,959 --> 00:01:55,079
Thank you for your concern.

19
00:01:55,439 --> 00:01:57,040
My wife doesn't like reading.

20
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:01,680
And Mr. Su is busy with swordplay all day,

21
00:02:02,319 --> 00:02:03,560
so you should have no time to read.

22
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:13,680
Take it slow.

23
00:02:14,439 --> 00:02:14,919
Be careful.

24
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:16,639
Sir,

25
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:18,120
what are they doing?

26
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,240
You don't know yet?

27
00:02:30,879 --> 00:02:32,159
The bookshop's business

28
00:02:32,599 --> 00:02:33,960
will all be mine from now on.

29
00:02:35,159 --> 00:02:35,719
Fu Xiang,

30
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:37,199
what underhanded tricks have you used this time?

31
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:38,759
I earned it fair and square.

32
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:40,360
Unlike some people,

33
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,360
who uses their husband

34
00:02:42,879 --> 00:02:43,759
to attract clients.

35
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,840
Say that again if you dare!

36
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:48,280
Oh, oh, oh.

37
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:48,879
Alright, alright.

38
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,080
How about this?

39
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:53,479
If the Su's Shop shuts down,

40
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:56,360
come work for me as a minor official.

41
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:57,879
I'll give you a job.

42
00:02:59,120 --> 00:02:59,639
Stop!

43
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,199
Jiao!

44
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:08,240
Miss Zhang,

45
00:03:08,879 --> 00:03:10,439
I wonder if there was anything

46
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:11,840
I did wrong in our previous cooperation.

47
00:03:12,159 --> 00:03:13,599
Why do you want to replace Su?

48
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:16,639
Based on your sword-drawing incident,

49
00:03:17,479 --> 00:03:18,680
I can replace you.

50
00:03:20,319 --> 00:03:21,759
I've always been fair in business.

51
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,960
Since you're not convinced,

52
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:26,000
I'll give you a chance to compete.

53
00:03:27,439 --> 00:03:29,039
Your agencies can compete.

54
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:29,879
The winner

55
00:03:30,439 --> 00:03:32,800
will get all the business of the Zhang family.

56
00:03:33,879 --> 00:03:34,919
What do you think?

57
00:03:35,639 --> 00:03:39,159
We'll do whatever you say.

58
00:03:40,919 --> 00:03:42,520
I'm afraid she doesn't dare to compete.

59
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:44,520
I...

60
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,199
We value our promise.

61
00:03:45,879 --> 00:03:46,919
We shouldn't judge the strength of a business

62
00:03:47,159 --> 00:03:48,599
by force.

63
00:03:48,879 --> 00:03:49,560
See?

64
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:50,719
I told you.

65
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:53,439
Are you afraid?

66
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,000
Take your time.

67
00:03:55,639 --> 00:03:57,360
You can go back and make a decision.

68
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:11,280
Let's go.

69
00:04:13,919 --> 00:04:14,439
Bah!

70
00:04:18,079 --> 00:04:18,720
Hurry up.

71
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,079
Hurry up.

72
00:04:20,079 --> 00:04:21,199
Hurry up.

73
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:22,759
Miss Zhang,

74
00:04:24,879 --> 00:04:26,079
why do you want to replace Su?

75
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,839
I'm in business,

76
00:04:27,839 --> 00:04:28,920
not running a charity.

77
00:04:29,399 --> 00:04:30,800
I only looked after the Sus

78
00:04:30,959 --> 00:04:31,959
because you were there.

79
00:04:32,279 --> 00:04:33,639
Now that you're leaving,

80
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:35,439
I'll choose a more suitable one.

81
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,639
I won't leave the Sus.

82
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:38,279
You're in a different position now.

83
00:04:39,279 --> 00:04:40,399
Some things

84
00:04:40,879 --> 00:04:41,959
are not up to you.

85
00:04:58,199 --> 00:04:58,759
I've decided

86
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,360
to compete with Fu Xiang.

87
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:01,879
Fine.

88
00:05:02,279 --> 00:05:03,199
They are bullying us.

89
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:04,399
Listen to the boss.

90
00:05:07,399 --> 00:05:08,360
He said the boss would win.

91
00:05:11,319 --> 00:05:12,120
You can order me

92
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,120
and my men at any time.

93
00:05:14,079 --> 00:05:16,240
Fu bullied your grandma back then.

94
00:05:16,439 --> 00:05:18,720
You can avenge her by beating his grandson.

95
00:05:19,959 --> 00:05:20,519
Beat him.

96
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,879
I'm also a member of our family.

97
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,319
Okay, it's settled.

98
00:05:29,879 --> 00:05:30,680
I disagree.

99
00:05:33,639 --> 00:05:34,399
Come out with me.

100
00:05:39,079 --> 00:05:40,279
Why don't you let me compete?

101
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:43,319
Don't you think this is unusual?

102
00:05:44,279 --> 00:05:45,680
This is between escorts.

103
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:46,959
It's not like writing an article.

104
00:05:47,079 --> 00:05:48,240
There's no need for so many twists and turns.

105
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,519
This is a private martial arts contest,

106
00:05:49,519 --> 00:05:50,639
not like the Nebula Conference.

107
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,399
It's inevitable to use real weapons.

108
00:05:52,519 --> 00:05:53,639
It's too dangerous.

109
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:55,759
It's none of your business.

110
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:58,199
But it's all because of me.

111
00:05:59,639 --> 00:06:00,160
Cheng Qi,

112
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,920
don't think you can boss around

113
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,480
just because you're the top

114
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,680
and brought business to the agency.

115
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,879
The Zhang family's business is backed by the Grand Preceptor.

116
00:06:07,279 --> 00:06:09,040
It's not as simple as it seems.

117
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,839
You're about to take over.

118
00:06:14,639 --> 00:06:16,560
Don't stir up trouble now, okay?

119
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:20,279
You just want me to take over so you can leave.

120
00:06:21,639 --> 00:06:22,519
My mother taught me

121
00:06:22,839 --> 00:06:24,279
Never start trouble, never fear it.

122
00:06:24,759 --> 00:06:25,839
If we just let them bully us like this,

123
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,160
the Escort Agency will be more difficult to establish itself.

124
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:29,079
Even if I'm forced to do this,

125
00:06:29,319 --> 00:06:30,079
I can't avoid it.

126
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:31,319
You don't need to

127
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,079
worry about this.

128
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:42,920
Don't beat around the bush.

129
00:06:44,279 --> 00:06:44,800
My Lord,

130
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,839
the form of the competition proposed by Miss Zhang

131
00:06:46,839 --> 00:06:48,319
is that each agency sends a representative.

132
00:06:48,519 --> 00:06:49,800
Either single or double.

133
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,279
The time is set for five days later.

134
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,279
The location is in the east of the city.

135
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:53,680
The winner

136
00:06:53,879 --> 00:06:56,040
can get all the business of Miss Zhang.

137
00:06:56,439 --> 00:06:57,519
But the loser

138
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:00,240
can't engage in related business for five years.

139
00:07:02,079 --> 00:07:03,920
The time is three days before my taking over.

140
00:07:07,079 --> 00:07:08,480
It sounds like she has ulterior motives.

141
00:07:09,439 --> 00:07:10,000
How about

142
00:07:10,399 --> 00:07:10,959
let's not compete.

143
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,360
A promise made must be kept.

144
00:07:12,519 --> 00:07:13,360
If you've agreed, you must compete.

145
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:14,959
Then,

146
00:07:15,839 --> 00:07:16,600
what if I lose?

147
00:07:18,959 --> 00:07:19,720
I'll compete with you.

148
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:20,839
Bet with my life.

149
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:21,600
Okay.

150
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:22,639
It's settled then.

151
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,600
Isn't this a bit hasty?

152
00:07:25,439 --> 00:07:25,759
No.

153
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:28,079
Fu Xiang thought I would choose a duel.

154
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:29,439
But Bai

155
00:07:30,279 --> 00:07:31,160
is unpredictable.

156
00:07:35,639 --> 00:07:36,720
How about waiting for Cheng Qi

157
00:07:36,959 --> 00:07:37,839
and asking for his opinion?

158
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:39,879
That's right, My Lord.

159
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,480
Let's wait for the son-in-law.

160
00:07:41,839 --> 00:07:43,079
Or we can go find him.

161
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,199
You go.

162
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:46,079
I won't go.

163
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:47,839
I heard that

164
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:50,480
the White Wolf Gang has been seen around Yunjing recently.

165
00:07:53,560 --> 00:07:56,040
He hasn't come back yet.

166
00:07:56,879 --> 00:07:58,079
He didn't become a bandit, did he?

167
00:07:59,879 --> 00:08:00,399
But

168
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,639
he doesn't have the conditions

169
00:08:01,639 --> 00:08:02,920
to become a bandit.

170
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,360
I'll go out for a while.

171
00:08:20,399 --> 00:08:21,600
My Lord, My Lord.

172
00:08:23,439 --> 00:08:25,160
My Lord got drunk in Huayue Tower.

173
00:08:25,399 --> 00:08:26,399
Tang Xin can testify to this.

174
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:27,519
Drink!

175
00:08:28,439 --> 00:08:29,360
Another pot!

176
00:08:30,079 --> 00:08:31,160
Stop talking!

177
00:08:32,519 --> 00:08:34,120
Stop talking!

178
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:37,919
Yicheng.

179
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:38,799
I'm here.

180
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:40,080
I feel bad.

181
00:08:41,279 --> 00:08:42,559
Where is

182
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:45,679
the dashing and unrestrained

183
00:08:45,679 --> 00:08:47,080
Mr. Cheng?

184
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,039
He's gone.

185
00:08:48,039 --> 00:08:49,320
He's disappeared.

186
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,440
Listen to me.

187
00:08:51,519 --> 00:08:52,720
I'm listening.

188
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,000
I'm so wronged.

189
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:56,720
Cut the crap.

190
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:57,600
Stop it.

191
00:08:59,399 --> 00:09:01,200
I'm thinking about her,

192
00:09:01,679 --> 00:09:02,840
but she doesn't want me to do it.

193
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:03,960
Yicheng,

194
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,039
am I wronged?

195
00:09:05,279 --> 00:09:06,120
Don't say that.

196
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:07,279
The escort agency is her family business,

197
00:09:07,279 --> 00:09:08,759
but it's also mine.

198
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:12,360
She can care about it,

199
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,799
but I can't, right?

200
00:09:14,039 --> 00:09:14,720
Don't stop me.

201
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,440
Let me finish.

202
00:09:16,519 --> 00:09:17,720
You...

203
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,000
And...

204
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:23,840
Are you done?

205
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:25,360
Come on.

206
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:27,879
Go open the door.

207
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:31,120
You drank too much.

208
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,159
You deserve to feel sick.

209
00:10:06,159 --> 00:10:07,679
How did I get back?

210
00:10:28,639 --> 00:10:29,440
What's going on with them?

211
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:30,399
This...

212
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:31,879
Son-in-law, calm down first.

213
00:10:31,879 --> 00:10:32,799
Calm down, calm down.

214
00:10:33,679 --> 00:10:34,919
My Lady is preparing to fight against Fu Xiang

215
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,559
with Bai Yanli in a double match.

216
00:10:37,159 --> 00:10:38,480
She still decided to compete.

217
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:39,679
Anyway, she has to compete.

218
00:10:39,919 --> 00:10:41,360
It's all for the escort agency.

219
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:43,639
No way.

220
00:10:45,799 --> 00:10:46,279
Don't mind him.

221
00:10:46,519 --> 00:10:47,360
Only I can stop it.

222
00:11:09,879 --> 00:11:11,080
Cheng Qi's book of poetry

223
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:12,399
is truly extraordinary.

224
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:14,159
I heard it's even sold to Langyue.

225
00:11:14,759 --> 00:11:16,440
The Princess of Langyue likes it very much.

226
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,720
What do you think

227
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:23,279
when the envoy from Langyue comes,

228
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,559
how about arranging a poetry recitation?

229
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:27,679
Your Majesty is wise.

230
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:29,440
In this way,

231
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:32,159
we can show our literary strength,

232
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:33,480
and display the imperial power.

233
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:35,559
Also, we can cater to their interests,

234
00:11:35,639 --> 00:11:36,679
to show our goodwill.

235
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:38,600
It's a win-win.

236
00:11:39,639 --> 00:11:41,320
Good, good.

237
00:11:41,879 --> 00:11:42,519
By the way,

238
00:11:42,879 --> 00:11:44,320
I'd like to meet this Cheng Qi.

239
00:11:44,759 --> 00:11:46,360
I'll arrange it right away.

240
00:11:46,639 --> 00:11:49,039
May I ask the official reason

241
00:11:49,639 --> 00:11:51,799
for summoning Cheng Qi?

242
00:11:53,559 --> 00:11:55,200
Does the official need a reason

243
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,639
to meet someone?

244
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:00,720
Cheng Qi has no official position

245
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:01,840
or academic achievements.

246
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:03,279
In my humble opinion,

247
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:05,600
it would be better to wait until

248
00:12:05,759 --> 00:12:06,720
after the meeting

249
00:12:07,159 --> 00:12:08,480
and the rewards.

250
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,679
Your Majesty loves the people like a father.

251
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:14,879
Mr. Yue is too rigid.

252
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:18,000
Mr. Yue is thoughtful.

253
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:19,039
All right.

254
00:12:19,279 --> 00:12:20,240
Later.

255
00:12:20,879 --> 00:12:22,159
Or the censors

256
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:23,879
will submit memorials again.

257
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:33,240
Lord Yue is worried that Cheng Qi will be favored.

258
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:36,879
His enemy will return to the court.

259
00:12:37,519 --> 00:12:38,960
He's just settling personal grudges.

260
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:42,480
The narrow-minded scholars

261
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:43,840
are all the same.

262
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:46,320
Father, about the speech,

263
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:47,480
prepare well.

264
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:50,399
You must shine before the royals.

265
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:55,720
So, Cheng Qi

266
00:12:56,279 --> 00:12:58,960
should stay in the shadows for now.

267
00:12:59,879 --> 00:13:00,840
No matter what,

268
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:02,840
he must be under my control.

269
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,399
The others

270
00:13:04,799 --> 00:13:06,639
are just walk-on parts.

271
00:13:07,519 --> 00:13:08,039
Yes.

272
00:13:08,759 --> 00:13:10,759
I'll let him stay in the villa

273
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:12,039
to prepare.

274
00:13:18,679 --> 00:13:19,360
What?

275
00:13:20,519 --> 00:13:21,759
You like him?

276
00:13:25,559 --> 00:13:26,960
Love

277
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,200
is normal,

278
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:30,679
but you must know your place.

279
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:32,240
The Zhang family

280
00:13:32,639 --> 00:13:34,399
doesn't need such a son-in-law.

281
00:13:35,159 --> 00:13:35,679
Yes,

282
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,320
I understand.

283
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:39,080
You may leave now.

284
00:14:00,159 --> 00:14:00,960
Okay.

285
00:14:24,919 --> 00:14:27,039
Good words.

286
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:31,279
Good words.

287
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:38,000
Keep going.

288
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:01,000
Help yourself.

289
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:01,279
Okay.

290
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,559
Come on, eat.

291
00:15:24,679 --> 00:15:25,960
Eat some meat.

292
00:16:16,480 --> 00:16:17,039
Thank you.

